# Use an authenticated workspace-admin session and its CSRF token.
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspace = REPLACE_WORKSPACE_UUID
@request = REPLACE_REQUEST_UUID
@member = REPLACE_TELEGRAM_USER_ID
@cookie = repodesk_session=REPLACE_SESSION
@csrf = REPLACE_CSRF

### Member API returns membership version and paginated Telegram profiles
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/members?offset=0
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Pending requests, current membership version, and shareable Telegram link
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-requests
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Approve as a regular member; use the GET response's version
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-requests/{{request}}/decision
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"approved","version":2}

### Reject without granting membership
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-requests/{{request}}/decision
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"rejected","version":2}

### Enroll or reactivate a member; all active members can use the bot
# Use the version returned by GET /members and refresh it after every successful edit.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/members
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"{{member}}","role":"member","active":true,"version":2}

### Deactivate membership to revoke access and cancel pending work
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/members
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"{{member}}","role":"member","active":false,"version":3}
